  summary: "Shankesh Jewellers designs and supplies handcrafted 18K and 22K gold jewellery to organised and independent retailers. FY26 PAT rose 165% and margins expanded sharply even though gold processed fell, but almost none of that profit converted to operating cash and net working-capital days lengthened to 81.",
