  summary: "Gaja is a promoter-led Indian alternative asset manager with more than two decades across private-equity cycles. FY26 PAT reached ₹81.96 crore, but management fees were only 38.07% of total income while carried interest and sponsor-investment income supplied 58.40%. The ₹450 crore fresh issue mainly finances illiquid sponsor commitments, so fund performance, realizations, capital deployment and cash conversion matter more than the headline margin.",
